From 87374621f1dfb3a09e6c1bdfe89ba9ade7506066 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: samuel <samuelMadureira23@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Wed, 14 Oct 2026 14:37:42 -0300
Subject: [PATCH 13/14] gpu: alpha test no FP buffered com funcao e referencia
 por constante (T-023)

rsx_fp_apply_alpha_test_dynamic: discard contra fp_alpha.x (ref) com a
funcao em fp_alpha.y; so o bit de alpha test ligado entra na chave do PSO
(no maximo 2 variantes por programa, early-Z preservado nos demais draws).
NO_ALPHATEST=1 desliga; FP_CONSTBUF=0 (literal) fica sem alpha test, como antes.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
